                            Join us for moderated, confidential support groups every [Day] at [Time] IST.
                            Share experiences, ask questions, and connect with others in a safe space.
                        </p>
                        <p class="note">Details coming soon. Subscribe to our mailing list to be notified of the first session.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="channel">
                        <h3>🤝 Reddit Community</h3>
                        <p><strong>For:</strong> Open discussions, questions, and peer support</p>
                        <p>
                            Join our Reddit community for ongoing conversations. Share your story, ask questions, and learn from others.
                        </p>
                        <a href="https://reddit.com/r/schizophreniasupport" class="btn" target="_blank">Join on Reddit</a>
                        <p class="note">Update with actual subreddit link when created</p>
                    </div>

